{"title": "Simple Interest (Level 1)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>A sum of money at simple rate of interest amounts to Rs. 689 in 3 years and Rs. 901 in 7 years. Find the principal amount.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 689 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; 7 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 901 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 640", "Rs. 600", "Rs. 550", "Rs. 530"], "options_hi": ["640 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "600 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "550 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "530 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Interest obtained in 4 years = 901  -  689 = Rs. 212</p><p>Interest obtained in 3 years = 212/4 * 3 = Rs. 159</p><p>Principal amount = 689  -  159 = Rs. 530</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Interest obtained in 4 years = 901  -  689 = Rs. 212</p><p>Interest obtained in 3 years = 212/4 * 3 = Rs. 159</p><p>Principal amount = 689  -  159 = Rs. 530</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The difference in simple interest on a certain sum at 12% per annum for 8 years and 15% per annum for 5 years is Rs 2100 then what is the sum?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 12% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 8 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 15% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; 2100 &#2352;&#2370;&#2346;&#2319; &#2361;&#2379;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2361; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs 12000", "Rs 18000", "Rs 10000", "Rs 15000"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369; 12000", "&#2352;&#2369; 18000", "&#2352;&#2369; 10000", "&#2352;&#2369; 15000"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the required sum = Rs P</p><p>According to the question; (P  X 12  X 8)/100-(P  X 15  X 5)/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; (96P-75P)/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; 21P/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; P=(2100  X 100)/21</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs 10000</p><p><b><u> </u></b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the required sum = Rs P</p><p>According to the question; (P  X 12  X 8)/100-(P  X 15  X 5)/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; (96P-75P)/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; 21P/100=2100</p><p>=&gt; P=(2100  X 100)/21</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs 10000</p><p><b><u> </u></b></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of money doubles itself in 4 years at simple interest. In how much time will it become 7 times at the same rate of interest?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2379;&#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351;&#2366;&#2357;&#2343;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2351;&#2361; 7 &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2351;&#2375;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["25 years", "23 years", "24 years", "21 years"], "options_hi": ["25 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "23 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "24 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "21 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let sum = P and rate of interest = R%</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>(P * R * 4)/100 = 2P  -  P</p><p>R = 25%</p><p>Now,</p><p>(P * 25 * t)/100 = 7P  -  P</p><p>t = 24 years</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let sum = P and rate of interest = R%</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>(P * R * 4)/100 = 2P  -  P</p><p>R = 25%</p><p>Now,</p><p>(P * 25 * t)/100 = 7P  -  P</p><p>t = 24 years</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A and B invested a total of Rs. 18000 at 15% and 12% simple rate of interest respectively for 3 years and they both get Rs. 7560 as interest amount. Find the amount invested by A.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2344;&#2375; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 15% &#2324;&#2352; 12% &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; 18000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 7560 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2375;&#2404; A &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 18000", "Rs. 16000", "Rs. 14000", "Rs. 12000"], "options_hi": ["18000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "16000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "14000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "12000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the amount invested by A = Rs. x</p><p>Then amount invested by B = 18000  -  x</p><p>According to question,</p><p>(x * 15 * 3)/100 + {(18000  -  x) * 12 * 3)/100 = Rs. 7560</p><p>(45x/100) + (648000  -  36x)/100 = 7560</p><p>(9x + 648000)/100 = 7560</p><p>9x = 108000</p><p>x = Rs. 12000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the amount invested by A = Rs. x</p><p>Then amount invested by B = 18000  -  x</p><p>According to question,</p><p>(x * 15 * 3)/100 + {(18000  -  x) * 12 * 3)/100 = Rs. 7560</p><p>(45x/100) + (648000  -  36x)/100 = 7560</p><p>(9x + 648000)/100 = 7560</p><p>9x = 108000</p><p>x = Rs. 12000</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>At what rate of percent per annum with simple interest will a sum of money double in 12.5 years?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 12.5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2379;&#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["8", "10", "12.5", "6"], "options_hi": ["8", "10", "12.5", "6"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>According to the question,</p><p>Simple interest = 2P - P = Rs. P</p><p>So,</p><p>P = P * R * T/100</p><p>R = 100/12.5 = 8%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>According to the question,</p><p>Simple interest = 2P - P = Rs. P</p><p>So,</p><p>P = P * R * T/100</p><p>R = 100/12.5 = 8%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Mr. Pankaj invested a certain amount at 8% per annum at simple interest. If the difference between the simple interest for 5 years and 6 years is Rs. 320, then what is the principal amount invested by Mr. Pankaj?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368; &#2346;&#2306;&#2325;&#2332; &#2344;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 8% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2324;&#2352; 6 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2352;&#2369;. 320 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2368; &#2346;&#2306;&#2325;&#2332; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 3600", "Rs. 2000", "Rs. 6500", "Rs. 4000"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 3600", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2000", "&#2352;&#2369;. 6500", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4000"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let Rs. P be the principal amount of money.</p><p>According to the question,</p><p>(P * 8 * 6)/100  -  (P * 8 * 5)/100 = 320</p><p>=&gt; 0.08P = 320</p><p>=&gt; P = 320/0.08</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 4000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let Rs. P be the principal amount of money.</p><p>According to the question,</p><p>(P * 8 * 6)/100  -  (P * 8 * 5)/100 = 320</p><p>=&gt; 0.08P = 320</p><p>=&gt; P = 320/0.08</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 4000</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Rahul invested &#8377;14400 for 't' years at 16 (2/3)% simple rate of interest. If interest amount received is &#8377;6000, then find the value of 't'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2352;&#2366;&#2361;&#2369;&#2354; &#2344;&#2375; 16 (2/3)% &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 't' &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#8377;14400 &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#8377;6000 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 't' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["3", "2", "2.5", "1.5"], "options_hi": ["3", "2", "2.5", "1.5"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Rate of interest = 16 (2/3)% = (50/3)%</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>(14400 * t * 50)/(3 * 100) = 6000</p><p>t = 2.5</p><p>Hence, value of 't' = 2.5</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Rate of interest = 16 (2/3)% = (50/3)%</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>(14400 * t * 50)/(3 * 100) = 6000</p><p>t = 2.5</p><p>Hence, value of 't' = 2.5</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A person invested Rs. 8000 in two schemes, some amount at a 12% rate of interest and the remaining amount at an 8% rate of interest for two years. If the simple interest received from both schemes is Rs. 1520, then find the amount invested at a 12% rate of interest. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 8000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;, &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 12% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 8% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 1520 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 12% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 4000", "Rs. 3000", "Rs. 5000", "Rs. 3500"], "options_hi": ["4000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "3000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "5000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "3500 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let the amount invested at a 12% rate of interest be Rs. 'X'. </p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>1520 = X * 12 * 2/100 + (8000  -  X) * 8 * 2/100 </p><p>152000 = 24X + 128000  -  16X </p><p>8X = 24000 </p><p>X = 3000 </p><p>Hence, the required value is Rs. 3000.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the amount invested at a 12% rate of interest be Rs. 'X'. </p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>1520 = X * 12 * 2/100 + (8000  -  X) * 8 * 2/100 </p><p>152000 = 24X + 128000  -  16X </p><p>8X = 24000 </p><p>X = 3000 </p><p>Hence, the required value is Rs. 3000.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If a person invested a certain amount in simple interest scheme at 21% rate of interest for four years and the interest received is Rs. 1050, then find the amount invested in simple interest.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 21% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2369;. 1050 &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 1000", "Rs. 1400", "Rs. 1250", "Rs. 1350"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 1000", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1400", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1250", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1350"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>=> 1050 = P * 21 * 4/100</p><p>=> P = (1050 * 100)/ (21 * 4)</p><p>=> P = Rs. 1250</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>=> 1050 = P * 21 * 4/100</p><p>=> P = (1050 * 100)/ (21 * 4)</p><p>=> P = Rs. 1250</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The interest earned on a sum of money at 15% rate of simple interest per annum in 5 years is &#8377;21600. What will be the simple interest on twice the sum at 12% rate per annum in 7 years?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; 15% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#8377;21600 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379;&#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 12% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 7 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377; 51624", "&#8377; 48640", "&#8377; 37680", "&#8377; 48384"], "options_hi": ["&#8377; 51624", "&#8377; 48640", "&#8377; 37680", "&#8377; 48384"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the principal be &#8377; P.</p><p>SI = (P * 15 * 5)/100</p><p>75P = 100 * 21600</p><p>P = 28800</p><p>So, required SI = (2 * 28800 * 12 * 7)/100 = &#8377; 48384</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the principal be &#8377; P.</p><p>SI = (P * 15 * 5)/100</p><p>75P = 100 * 21600</p><p>P = 28800</p><p>So, required SI = (2 * 28800 * 12 * 7)/100 = &#8377; 48384</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The rate of simple interest for first 2 years is 7.5% per annum, for the next 4 years it is 10% per annum and for the period beyond this, it is 14%. If the simple interest for 10 years is Rs. 493.95, what is the principal?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; 7.5% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2309;&#2327;&#2354;&#2375; 4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2351;&#2361; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360;&#2360;&#2375; &#2310;&#2327;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2309;&#2357;&#2343;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2351;&#2361; 14% &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 10 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2352;&#2369;. 493.95 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 445", "Rs. 460", "Rs. 425", "Rs. 450"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 445", "&#2352;&#2369;. 460", "&#2352;&#2369;. 425", "&#2352;&#2369;. 450"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. 100.</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the first 2 years = 2 * 7.5 = Rs. 15</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the next 4 years = 4 * 10 = Rs. 40</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the further next 4 years = 4 * 14 = Rs. 56</p><p>Total SI = 15 + 40 + 56 = Rs. 111</p><p>If SI is Rs. 111 then principal = Rs. 100</p><p>If SI is Rs. 493.95 then principal = 100 * 493.95/111 = Rs. 445</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. 100.</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the first 2 years = 2 * 7.5 = Rs. 15</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the next 4 years = 4 * 10 = Rs. 40</p><p>SI on Rs. 100 for the further next 4 years = 4 * 14 = Rs. 56</p><p>Total SI = 15 + 40 + 56 = Rs. 111</p><p>If SI is Rs. 111 then principal = Rs. 100</p><p>If SI is Rs. 493.95 then principal = 100 * 493.95/111 = Rs. 445</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The amount received after 8 years on a certain sum of money invested at the rate of 18% simple interest per annum is &#8377;1,220. What was the initial sum invested?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 18% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 8 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2343;&#2344; &#8377;1,220 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2352;&#2306;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377; 500", "&#8377; 480", "&#8377; 420", "&#8377; 450"], "options_hi": ["&#8377; 500", "&#8377; 480", "&#8377; 420", "&#8377; 450"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Amount received = interest + principal</p><p>1220 = (p X 18 X 8)/100 + p</p><p>122000 = p X 18 X 8 + p X 100</p><p>122000 = 244p</p><p>p = &#8377; 500</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount received = interest + principal</p><p>1220 = (p X 18 X 8)/100 + p</p><p>122000 = p X 18 X 8 + p X 100</p><p>122000 = 244p</p><p>p = &#8377; 500</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Sashi took a loan of &#8377;700 on simple interest for as many years as the rate of interest per annum, if he paid &#8377; 343 as interest at the end of the loan period, what was the rate of interest?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2358;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#8377;700 &#2325;&#2366; &#2315;&#2339; &#2313;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2361;&#2368; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2315;&#2339; &#2309;&#2357;&#2343;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#8377; 343 &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["6%", "4%", "10%", "7%"], "options_hi": ["6%", "4%", "10%", "7%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Simple interest = prt/100</p><p>Given, t = r</p><p>Hence, 700 X r<sup>2</sup>/100 = 343</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = 49</p><p>Rate of interest = r = 7%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Simple interest = prt/100</p><p>Given, t = r</p><p>Hence, 700 X r<sup>2</sup>/100 = 343</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = 49</p><p>Rate of interest = r = 7%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum at simple interest at 8% per annum amounts to Rs.29865 after 4 years. What is the simple interest?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; 8% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2352;&#2369;. 29865 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.7640", "Rs.7240", "Rs.6820", "Rs.8020"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.7640", "&#2352;&#2369;.7240", "&#2352;&#2369;.6820", "&#2352;&#2369;.8020"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Amount = Rs.29865</p><p>Principal + simple interest = 29865</p><p>100 * simple interest/ (rate * time) + simple interest = 29865</p><p>100 * simple interest/ (8 * 4) + simple interest = 29865</p><p>132 * simple interest/32 = 29865</p><p>Simple interest = 29865 * 8/33 = 905 * 8 = Rs.7240</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount = Rs.29865</p><p>Principal + simple interest = 29865</p><p>100 * simple interest/ (rate * time) + simple interest = 29865</p><p>100 * simple interest/ (8 * 4) + simple interest = 29865</p><p>132 * simple interest/32 = 29865</p><p>Simple interest = 29865 * 8/33 = 905 * 8 = Rs.7240</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum amounts to Rs.4298.4 at 13.2% rate of simple interest after 7.5 years. What is the simple interest on same sum at 6.5 rate of interest after 2 years and 6 months?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>7.5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 13.2% &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2352;&#2369;. 4298.4 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2324;&#2352; 6 &#2350;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 6.5 &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.351", "Rs.297", "Rs.339", "Rs.373"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 351", "&#2352;&#2369;. 297", "&#2352;&#2369;. 339", "&#2352;&#2369;. 373"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let sum = Rs. P</p><p>Then, 4298.4  -  P = P * 13.2 * 7.5/100</p><p>P = 2160</p><p>New time period = 2 + 6/12 = 5/2 years</p><p>Now, SI on same sum at 6.5 rate of interest after 2 years and 6 months</p><p>= 2160 * 6.5 * (5/2))/100</p><p>= <b>Rs.351</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let sum = Rs. P</p><p>Then, 4298.4  -  P = P * 13.2 * 7.5/100</p><p>P = 2160</p><p>New time period = 2 + 6/12 = 5/2 years</p><p>Now, SI on same sum at 6.5 rate of interest after 2 years and 6 months</p><p>= 2160 * 6.5 * (5/2))/100</p><p>= <b>Rs.351</b></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>In what time does an amount becomes 2.5 times of itself at simple interest with rate of 10% per annum?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2381;&#2357;&#2351;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; 2.5 &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["5 years", "10 years", "15 years", "20 years"], "options_hi": ["5 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "10 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "15 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "20 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let principal amount = P</p><p>Interest in t years = 2.5P  -  P = 1.5P</p><p>1.5P = P*10*t/100</p><p>t = 15 years</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let principal amount = P</p><p>Interest in t years = 2.5P  -  P = 1.5P</p><p>1.5P = P*10*t/100</p><p>t = 15 years</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The simple interest accrued on a sum of Rs.6700 at the end of 4 years is Rs.2144. If the rate of interest is 3% lesser, then the interest would be:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 6700 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 2144 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; 3% &#2325;&#2350; &#2361;&#2379;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;:</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.1380", "Rs.1280", "Rs.1340", "Rs.1260"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.1380", "&#2352;&#2369;.1280", "&#2352;&#2369;.1340", "&#2352;&#2369;.1260"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the rate of interest = R%</p><p>Then,</p><p>2144 = 6700 * 4 * R/100</p><p>R = 32/4</p><p>R = 8%</p><p>Now,</p><p>R = 8%  -  3% = 5%</p><p>Simple interest = 6700 * 5 * 4/100 = 67 * 20 = Rs.1340</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the rate of interest = R%</p><p>Then,</p><p>2144 = 6700 * 4 * R/100</p><p>R = 32/4</p><p>R = 8%</p><p>Now,</p><p>R = 8%  -  3% = 5%</p><p>Simple interest = 6700 * 5 * 4/100 = 67 * 20 = Rs.1340</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If ratio of principal and simple interest for 1 year is 20: 3, then the rate of interest is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; 1 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 20: 3 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["13%", "14%", "16%", "15%"], "options_hi": ["13%", "14%", "16%", "15%"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Given the ratio of principal and simple interest = 20: 3</p><p>This means that on a principal of Rs.20, you are gaining an interest of Rs.3.</p><p>Hence, Rs.15 on Rs.100. Thus Rate% = 15%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given the ratio of principal and simple interest = 20: 3</p><p>This means that on a principal of Rs.20, you are gaining an interest of Rs.3.</p><p>Hence, Rs.15 on Rs.100. Thus Rate% = 15%</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of money deposited at simple interest amounts to Rs.1840 in 3 years and Rs.1240 in 2 years. The sum deposited is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2332;&#2350;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2369;.1840 &#2324;&#2352; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2369;.1240 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2350;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; ___ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.40", "Rs.20", "Rs.44", "Rs.60"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.40", "&#2352;&#2369;.20", "&#2352;&#2369;.44", "&#2352;&#2369;.60"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Simple interest of 1 year = 1840  -  1240 = Rs.600</p><p>Simple interest of 2 years = 2 * 600 = Rs.1200</p><p>Sum deposited = 1240  -  1200 = Rs.40</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Simple interest of 1 year = 1840  -  1240 = Rs.600</p><p>Simple interest of 2 years = 2 * 600 = Rs.1200</p><p>Sum deposited = 1240  -  1200 = Rs.40</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If a sum of money becomes 3 times itself in three years at a certain rate of simple interest, then find the rate of interest.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["8(1/6) %", "12(1/6) %", "66 (2/3) %", "8(1/3) %"], "options_hi": ["8(1/6) %", "12(1/6) %", "66 (2/3) %", "8(1/3) %"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. 'P'.</p><p>Then, simple interest = (3P  -  P) = 2P</p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>2P = P * R * 3/100</p><p>R = 200/3</p><p>Hence, Rate of interest = 66 (2/3) %</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. 'P'.</p><p>Then, simple interest = (3P  -  P) = 2P</p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>2P = P * R * 3/100</p><p>R = 200/3</p><p>Hence, Rate of interest = 66 (2/3) %</p>"}]}